    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Tsucora Kalashtar</h2>\n<p>The tsucora are the quori of classic nightmares, feeding on terror. If you have this quori ancestry, you can choose one of the following paths.</p>\n<h3>Tsucora Emancipator</h3>\n<p>You gain the ability to control and dampen the influence fear has over you, and your allies. Allies under the effect of your @Compendium[pathfinders-guide-to-eberron.eberron-spells.Zis7Jnr46Ug894eQ]{Link Mind} gain a +1 status bonus to their saves against effects with the Fear trait.</p>"
